## 图的表示方法

### 1. 邻接矩阵
```java
int[][] graph = new int[n][n];
// graph[i][j] = 1 表示顶点i和j之间有边
```
- 优点：判断两点之间是否有边O(1)
- 缺点：空间复杂度O(n²)，稀疏图浪费空间

### 2. 邻接表
```java
List<List<Integer>> graph = new ArrayList<>();
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    graph.add(new ArrayList<>());
}
// 添加边
graph.get(u).add(v);
```
- 优点：空间复杂度O(V+E)，适合稀疏图
- 缺点：判断两点之间是否有边O(degree)

### 3. 边列表
```java
List<int[]> edges = new ArrayList<>();
edges.add(new int[]{u, v});
```
- 优点：简单，适合Kruskal算法
- 缺点：查询效率低

## 图的遍历

### 1. 广度优先搜索（BFS）
- 使用队列
- 逐层遍历
- 用于找最短路径（无权图）

```java
public void bfs(List<List<Integer>> graph, int start) {
    boolean[] visited = new boolean[graph.size()];
    Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();
    queue.offer(start);
    visited[start] = true;

    while (!queue.isEmpty()) {
        int node = queue.poll();
        System.out.println(node);
        for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
            if (!visited[neighbor]) {
                visited[neighbor] = true;
                queue.offer(neighbor);
            }
        }
    }
}
```

### 2. 深度优先搜索（DFS）
- 使用栈或递归
- 深度优先
- 用于检测环、拓扑排序

```java
public void dfs(List<List<Integer>> graph, int node, boolean[] visited) {
    visited[node] = true;
    System.out.println(node);
    for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
        if (!visited[neighbor]) {
            dfs(graph, neighbor, visited);
        }
    }
}
```

### 3. BFS vs DFS
| 对比项 | BFS | DFS |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 数据结构 | 队列 | 栈/递归 |
| 空间复杂度 | O(V) | O(V) |
| 时间复杂度 | O(V+E) | O(V+E) |
| 最短路径 | 是（无权图） | 否 |
| 应用场景 | 最短路径、层序遍历 | 检测环、拓扑排序 |

## 拓扑排序

### 定义
拓扑排序是对有向无环图（DAG）的顶点进行线性排序，使得对于每条边(u, v)，u在排序中出现在v之前。

### 应用场景
- 任务调度
- 课程安排
- 编译顺序
- 依赖关系

### 算法实现（Kahn算法 - BFS）
```java
public List<Integer> topologicalSort(List<List<Integer>> graph, int n) {
    int[] inDegree = new int[n];
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        for (int neighbor : graph.get(i)) {
            inDegree[neighbor]++;
        }
    }

    Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        if (inDegree[i] == 0) {
            queue.offer(i);
        }
    }

    List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();
    while (!queue.isEmpty()) {
        int node = queue.poll();
        result.add(node);
        for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
            inDegree[neighbor]--;
            if (inDegree[neighbor] == 0) {
                queue.offer(neighbor);
            }
        }
    }

    if (result.size() != n) {
        // 图中有环
        return new ArrayList<>();
    }
    return result;
}
```

### 检测环
- 如果拓扑排序结果包含所有顶点，则无环
- 否则，图中有环

// 图基础操作示例
import java.util.*;

public class GraphBasics {

    // 1. 邻接表表示
    static class Graph {
        private int V;
        private List<List<Integer>> adj;

        public Graph(int V) {
            this.V = V;
            this.adj = new ArrayList<>();
            for (int i = 0; i < V; i++) {
                adj.add(new ArrayList<>());
            }
        }

        public void addEdge(int u, int v) {
            adj.get(u).add(v);
            adj.get(v).add(u); // 无向图
        }

        public List<Integer> getNeighbors(int v) {
            return adj.get(v);
        }
    }

    // 2. BFS遍历
    public static List<Integer> bfs(List<List<Integer>> graph, int start) {
        List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();
        boolean[] visited = new boolean[graph.size()];
        Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();
        queue.offer(start);
        visited[start] = true;

        while (!queue.isEmpty()) {
            int node = queue.poll();
            result.add(node);
            for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
                if (!visited[neighbor]) {
                    visited[neighbor] = true;
                    queue.offer(neighbor);
                }
            }
        }
        return result;
    }

    // 3. DFS遍历
    public static List<Integer> dfs(List<List<Integer>> graph, int start) {
        List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();
        boolean[] visited = new boolean[graph.size()];
        dfsHelper(graph, start, visited, result);
        return result;
    }

    private static void dfsHelper(List<List<Integer>> graph, int node, 
                                  boolean[] visited, List<Integer> result) {
        visited[node] = true;
        result.add(node);
        for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
            if (!visited[neighbor]) {
                dfsHelper(graph, neighbor, visited, result);
            }
        }
    }

    // 4. 拓扑排序
    public static List<Integer> topologicalSort(List<List<Integer>> graph, int n) {
        int[] inDegree = new int[n];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            for (int neighbor : graph.get(i)) {
                inDegree[neighbor]++;
            }
        }

        Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (inDegree[i] == 0) {
                queue.offer(i);
            }
        }

        List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();
        while (!queue.isEmpty()) {
            int node = queue.poll();
            result.add(node);
            for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
                inDegree[neighbor]--;
                if (inDegree[neighbor] == 0) {
                    queue.offer(neighbor);
                }
            }
        }

        return result.size() == n ? result : new ArrayList<>();
    }

    // 5. 检测有向图是否有环
    public static boolean hasCycle(List<List<Integer>> graph, int n) {
        int[] inDegree = new int[n];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            for (int neighbor : graph.get(i)) {
                inDegree[neighbor]++;
            }
        }

        Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (inDegree[i] == 0) {
                queue.offer(i);
            }
        }

        int count = 0;
        while (!queue.isEmpty()) {
            int node = queue.poll();
            count++;
            for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
                inDegree[neighbor]--;
                if (inDegree[neighbor] == 0) {
                    queue.offer(neighbor);
                }
            }
        }

        return count != n;
    }

    // 6. 无向图检测环（DFS）
    public static boolean hasCycleUndirected(List<List<Integer>> graph, int n) {
        boolean[] visited = new boolean[n];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (!visited[i]) {
                if (dfsCycleCheck(graph, i, -1, visited)) {
                    return true;
                }
            }
        }
        return false;
    }

    private static boolean dfsCycleCheck(List<List<Integer>> graph, int node, 
                                         int parent, boolean[] visited) {
        visited[node] = true;
        for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {
            if (!visited[neighbor]) {
                if (dfsCycleCheck(graph, neighbor, node, visited)) {
                    return true;
                }
            } else if (neighbor != parent) {
                return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}
